# Monsta Live

Monsta Live is a premium 18+ live streaming platform where creators can stream live, build communities, and earn money through subscriptions, tips, gifts, and private shows.

## Features

- 🔴 Live HD streaming
- 💬 Real-time chat
- 💰 Virtual tokens and tipping
- 👑 Creator subscriptions
- 🔒 Secure authentication
- 🪪 Creator verification (KYC)
- 📊 Creator analytics dashboard
- 💳 Mobile Money, Visa, Mastercard, Flutterwave & Paystack support
- 📱 Responsive web application
- 🛡️ Admin dashboard and content moderation

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

### Backend
- NestJS
- Node.js

### Database
- PostgreSQL

### Streaming
- LiveKit

### Storage
- Cloudflare R2

### Deployment
- Docker
- AWS / DigitalOcean

## Project Status

🚧 Currently under active development.

